flowchart TD
  S([Answer all four questions]) --> Q1{1. Who is the<br/>decision for?}
  Q1 -- UK central government --> R1[Green Book rules]
  Q1 -- US federal government --> R2[OMB and GAO rules]
  Q1 -- anyone else --> R3[General method]
  R1 --> Q2
  R2 --> Q2
  R3 --> Q2
  Q2{2. How reversible is it,<br/>and how much is at stake?} --> D1[Quick: reversible, low stakes]
  Q2 --> D2[Standard: one of the two]
  Q2 --> D3[Full: hard to reverse, high stakes]
  D1 --> Q3
  D2 --> Q3
  D3 --> Q3
  Q3{3. Will it be scrutinised?<br/>auditor, regulator, board, public} -- yes --> F1[Must be defensible:<br/>pass/fail tests, full audit trail]
  Q3 -- no --> F2[Normal record-keeping]
  F1 --> Q4
  F2 --> Q4
  Q4{4. Can analysis answer it now?} -- yes --> GO([Go to tree 3])
  Q4 -- no, cause and effect unclear --> PI([Pilot or stage it first])
